{"text":"TTien, with hardly a break in her consciousness, she got up, pushed the thin rug against the door, made sure the windows were tight shut, put two shilhngs in the meter, and turned on the gas. For the first time since she had been in the room she lay on the. hard bed that smelled stale, that smelled of sweat and sex.\n\nShe lay on her back on the green satin cover, but her legs were chilly. She got up, found a blanket folded in the bottom of the chest of drawers, and carefully covered her legs with it. She was quite content lying there, listening to the faint soft hiss of the gas that poured into the room, into her lungs, into her brain, as she drifted off into the dark river.","voice":"en-US-AriaNeural","words":[[0.1,0.7625,0,5],[0.95,1.0875,7,11],[1.1,1.5125,12,18],[1.525,1.6,19,20],[1.6125,1.925,21,26],[1.9375,2.0,27,29],[2.0125,2.15,30,33],[2.1625,2.8875,34,47],[3.0625,3.225,49,52],[3.2375,3.475,53,56],[3.4875,3.725,57,59],[3.9375,4.2875,61,67],[4.3,4.3875,68,71],[4.4,4.7,72,76],[4.7125,4.95,77,80],[4.9625,5.35,81,88],[5.3625,5.45,89,92],[5.4625,5.8125,93,97],[6.075,6.275,99,103],[6.2875,6.5875,104,108],[6.6,6.7,109,112],[6.7125,7.1625,113,120],[7.175,7.2875,121,125],[7.3,7.625,126,131],[7.6375,7.9875,132,136],[8.2375,8.45,138,141],[8.4625,8.6625,142,145],[8.675,9.125,146,154],[9.1375,9.2,155,157],[9.2125,9.275,158,161],[9.2875,9.6375,162,167],[9.8375,9.95,169,172],[9.9625,10.2625,173,179],[10.275,10.3875,180,182],[10.4,10.475,183,186],[10.4875,11.0125,187,190],[11.8875,12.0875,192,195],[12.1,12.2,196,199],[12.2125,12.5125,200,205],[12.525,12.8375,206,210],[12.85,13.1,211,216],[13.1125,13.25,217,220],[13.2625,13.4,221,224],[13.4125,13.5625,225,229],[13.575,13.6375,230,232],[13.65,13.7375,233,236],[13.75,14.05,237,241],[14.0625,14.225,242,245],[14.2375,14.4375,246,249],[14.45,14.6,250,252],[14.6125,14.8375,253,256],[15.7,16.05,258,262],[16.0625,16.3,263,266],[16.3125,16.45,267,271],[16.4625,16.8,272,279],[16.8125,17.3125,280,285],[17.475,17.65,287,291],[1